  "behavior": [
    "Public TextInferencePolicy reaches raw-token and prepared-input ordinary/controlled MLX prefill; smaller admitted chunks remain valid under larger public maxima. Snapshot configuration identity includes the policy.",
    "Direct unbounded strict requests reject during coordinated admission before controller or native preparation; the facade uses its existing finite 256-token fallback.",
    "Prepared speculative facade and direct native routes reject unintegrated policies before execution, including a policy on a later batch lane. Public MLX managed capacities reject UnknownBound rather than bypassing policy.",
    "Selected resident transaction quotes include checkpoint and possible rollback copies. Ordinary/fixed and pooling storage shares; compressed capacity and logical arrays copy independently. Missing copy facts remain unknown and cold state is unchanged.",
    "SelectedStateBacking preserves exact geometry and physical capacity independently from logical state and media. Either attachment order rejects different geometry; strict admission and pool reservation reject explicit missing bounds despite stale completeness.",
    "Prepared native composition combines prompt, transaction/equation, sampling, controller and selected backing with mandatory enclosing bounds. Native Metal validates the composition while preserving missing prompt or external components.",
    "Unquoted-owner leases atomically exclude all live reservations, including zero-byte reservations. Clones share a blocker; exact storage can publish before releasing it. Overflow, poisoning and concurrent admission are covered.",
    "Static target inventories exclude decoder state while retaining and deduplicating parameters and sources. Existing request charges survive snapshots, cancellation/recovery and escaped opaque token handles."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "Public MLX managed-capacity admission remains explicitly rejected. The native shared domain has not yet installed complete participation before loading, independent preparation, session work, copies and output escapes.",
    "Speculative policy rejection is a temporary implementation gap, not architectural inapplicability. Dynamic grammar controller bounds remain incomplete.",
    "Raw logits/native-array descendants, independent snapshot/capture reservations and incremental state-charge promotion still need complete ownership accounting.",
    "Full streaming/materialization, parallel, media, prediction and observation admission remain outstanding. Equation and local native tests do not establish complete family/path enforcement.",
    "No new released-checkpoint or process/allocator peak measurement was performed. Prior pinned Qwen numerical and memory records remain separate.",
    "Runtime focused tests include the two unquoted overflow/poison tests also run independently; these are counted once. Existing native unused-helper and linker warnings remain."
  ],
